er (1px gray line\n * around `.ck-editor__editable`) was being clipped by the EditorFrame's\n * `overflow: hidden` wrapper.\n *\n * Also explicitly forces a visible 1px gray border on `.ck-editor__editable`\n * because CKEditor 5's default theme leaves the editable's border transparent\n * (the visible \"editor frame\" border in collapsed view comes from a different\n * `.ck-editor` wrapper that DecoupledEditor doesn't render). Without this,\n * even when the editor fit inside the dialog the border was invisible.\n *\n * Scope all overrides to `[data-testid=\"rtev2-editor-frame-fullscreen\"]` so\n * they only apply inside our dialog and never touch the collapsed view.\n *\n * ADO 6383131 / ICM 21000000958744 (Repair item #3 of 4).\n */[data-testid=rtev2-editor-frame-fullscreen]{box-sizing:border-box}.rte-dark-theme [data-testid=rtev2-editor-frame-fullscreen],[data-testid=rtev2-editor-frame-fullscreen] .rte-dark-theme{background:#1e1e1e;color:#d4d4d4}[data-testid=rtev2-editor-frame-fullscreen] .ck-editor__editable[contenteditable=true],[data-testid=rtev2-editor-frame-fullscreen] .ck-editor__editable_inline[contenteditable=true],[data-testid=rtev2-editor-frame-fullscreen] .ck.ck-content[contenteditable=true]{border:1px solid #d1d1d1 !important;box-sizing:border-box;height:calc(90vh - 200px) !important;margin-bottom:10px;max-height:calc(90vh - 200px) !important;min-height:200px;overflow-y:auto}",""]);const l=o},3443:(e,t,i)=>{"use strict";i.d(t,{Z:()=>l});var a=i(9372),r=i.n(a),n=i(3286),o=i.n(n)()(r());o.push([e.id,".rtev2-paragraph-spacing .ck-content p:not(.collapsible_panel_body>p){margin:1em 0}.rtev2-paragraph-spacing .ck-content li p:not(.collapsible_panel_body>p){margin:0}",""]);const l=o},8318:(e,t,i)=>{"use strict";i.d(t,{Z:()=>l});var a=i(9372),r=i.n(a),n=i(3286),o=i.n(n)()(r());o.push([e.id,'.ck-content figure.table:not(.layout-table)[style*="height: 100%"],.ck-content figure.table:not(.layout-table)[style*="height:100%"]{height:auto !important}.ck-content b